        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Our Exciting New Book for Christian Parents - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/our-exciting-new-book-for-christian-parents/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Our Exciting New Book for Christian Parents - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Every parent feels it. They know they should be studying the Bible with their children and just don’t know how to take the next step. So, the years tick away and the guilt piles up. And it’s not just the problem of being too busy. For many parents, they just don’t know where to begin. [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/our-exciting-new-book-for-christian-parents/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-03-23T15:18:33+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-03-23T20:28:42+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2026/03/GNFD-4-Cover-scaled.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1885\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"2560\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" />\n<