      "title": "How Many New Testament Manuscripts Do We Have from the Second Century?",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/how-many-new-testament-manuscripts-do-we-have-from-the-second-century-2/",
      "sha256": "6a6b22c6b7a6b6d4e506d83bf953346366cd54176e4b12f95627a6ca62596862",
      "bytes": 5203,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\16219.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:12:44.398495+00:00",
