          "og_title": "Helping Christian Students Keep Their Faith in College",
          "og_description": "Well, it just happened for the third time. This past week, I dropped off my last child at college. As might be expected, there were lots of emotions. Excitement, nervousness, fear. And that was just me! My wife Melissa wrote a wonderful post about seeing your last child graduate high school which you can read [&hellip;]",
