        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Class on the Origin and Authority of the New Testament Canon - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/class-on-the-origin-and-authority-of-the-new-testament-canon/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Class on the Origin and Authority of the New Testament Canon - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"This week, Aug 4-8, I am teaching my long-running elective at RTS Charlotte entitled, &#8220;The Origin and Authority of the New Testament Canon.” In this class, we will be covering not just the history and development of the canon, but also its theological meaning, and its epistemological foundation.  In other words, we will not only [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/class-on-the-origin-and-authority-of-the-new-testament-canon/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-08-04T16:15:20+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-09-08T17:10:25+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/canon.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1065\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\