        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>The Brilliant Apologetic Strategy of the Ancient Church - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/the-brilliant-apologetic-strategy-of-the-ancient-church/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Brilliant Apologetic Strategy of the Ancient Church - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"One of the benefits of studying the history of early Christianity is that we quickly realize that what we are facing in the modern day is far from new. Each challenge to the faith might seem new—sometimes leading to an unnecessary panic among some—but the early church faced similar (and often much worse) things before. [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/the-brilliant-apologetic-strategy-of-the-ancient-church/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-07-21T12:44:11+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-07-21T17:50:20+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2025/07/Tertullian2.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"800\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"978\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. readi