        "title": {
          "rendered": "How to Have Healthy Disagreements in the Church"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "<p>During the <a href=\"https://www.tgc25.org/event/5c7c7875-3a03-451a-81bb-07826097b7f6/join-us-in-april\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TGC National Conference</a> this past April, I was part of a panel discussion with Alistair Begg, Gavin Ortlund, and Jen Wilkin on the topic of &#8220;How to Have Healthy Disagreements within Your Church.&#8221;  The panel was hosted by Carl Laferton of <a href=\"https://www.thegoodbook.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the Good Book Company</a>.</p>\n<p>I have to say that I can&#8217;t imagine many topics more timely than this one. It was encouraging to hear the perspectives of my fellow panelists on how the evangelical community needs more grace, charity and maturity in the way we disagree. Here&#8217;s the video:</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dzTE0mBwS54?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>During the TGC National Conference this past April, I was part of a panel discussion with Alistair Begg, Gavin Ortlund, and Jen Wilkin on the topic of &#8220;How to Have Healthy Disagreements within Your Church.&#8221;  The panel was hosted by Carl Laferton of the Good Book Company. I have to say that I can&#8217;t imagine [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
