          "og_title": "Is All High Christology Necessarily Orthodox?",
          "og_description": "One of the classic, and seemingly never-ending, debates among New Testament scholars is whether Jesus’s earliest followers viewed him as fully divine, and (perhaps more importantly), whether Jesus viewed himself as fully divine. Some scholars say yes to both, some say no to both, and some are mixed. In fact, I will be speaking on [&hellip;]",
