        "title": {
          "rendered": "What Happens When a Christian Student Goes to a Secular College?"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "<p>As I indicated in <a href=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/is-biblical-literacy-an-issue-for-the-average-christian/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">last week&#8217;s post</a>, I am starting a new 10-part video series on big questions related to the faith, and particularly the origins and reliability of the New Testament.</p>\n<p>So, here&#8217;s the next installment in the series: &#8220;What Happens When a Christian Student Goes to a Secular College?&#8221;</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5KDn1zzjg7g?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent&#038;listType=playlist&#038;list=PLM2gyA4vMHF1K-6XsFWFSmKqXG0bs1a2C\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>As I indicated in last week&#8217;s post, I am starting a new 10-part video series on big questions related to the faith, and particularly the origins and reliability of the New Testament. So, here&#8217;s the next installment in the series: &#8220;What Happens When a Christian Student Goes to a Secular College?&#8221;</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
