        "title": {
          "rendered": "Is Biblical Literacy an Issue for the Average Christian?"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "<p>Over the years, I have done an enormous amount of video interviews related to the origins and reliability of the Bible. I have been able to collect some of the more recent clips and form them into a 10-part video series on a number of important issues. So, this post marks the first in a series of videos I will post over the next couple months.</p>\n<p>The first installment below pertains to biblical literacy among Christians. Even though Christians claim the Bible is the word of God, does the average Christian really read it? And if they don&#8217;t, what are some reasons we should pursue biblical literacy more urgently?  Here you go!</p>\n<p><span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IaX9rSo-KcI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent&#038;listType=playlist&#038;list=PLM2gyA4vMHF1K-6XsFWFSmKqXG0bs1a2C\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Over the years, I have done an enormous amount of video interviews related to the origins and reliability of the Bible. I have been able to collect some of the more recent clips and form them into a 10-part video series on a number of important issues. So, this post marks the first in a [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
