        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>The Dead Sea Scrolls, the Book of Esther, and the Argument from Silence - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Dead Sea Scrolls, the Book of Esther, and the Argument from Silence - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"When we want to know how the New Testament canon developed, we have a number of sources at our disposal. Most fundamentally, we have patristic sources—the writings of the church fathers—which can show us when books were known, read, and cited. We also have archaeological evidence at our disposal. We continue to find manuscripts of [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-03-25T12:24:44+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-03-25T14:23:56+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2024/03/dead-sea-scroll-677135_1920.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1920\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1280\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Michael Kruger\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"headline\":\"The Dead Sea Scrolls, the Book of Esther, and the Argument from Silence\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-03-25T12:24:44+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-03-25T14:23:56+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence\\/\"},\"wordCount\":947,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence\\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/5mt.michaeljkruger.com\\/2024\\/03\\/dead-sea-scroll-677135_1920.jpg\",\"keywords\":[\"Argument from Silence\",\"Dead Sea Scrolls\",\"Esther\",\"NT Canon\"],\"articleSection\":[\"Ancient Manuscripts\",\"New Testament Canon\",\"Textual Criticism\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea-scrolls-the-book-of-esther-and-the-argument-from-silence\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/the-dead-sea