        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Is the Book of James Really &#039;An Epistle of Straw&#039;? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Is the Book of James Really &#039;An Epistle of Straw&#039;? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We have a lot of books in our New Testament. All of them, we believe, are divinely inspired. And yet we don’t spend equal amounts of time reading them. For most of us, our reading pattern is profoundly lopsided, focusing mostly on Paul (especially Romans and Galatians) and the Gospels (with John leading the way). [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-01-29T14:29:12+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-01-29T15:00:42+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2024/01/Straw-scaled-e1706540422969.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1638\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"2009\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Michael Kruger\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"headline\":\"Is the Book of James Really &#8216;An Epistle of Straw&#8217;?\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-01-29T14:29:12+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-01-29T15:00:42+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/\"},\"wordCount\":1049,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/5mt.michaeljkruger.com\\/2024\\/01\\/Straw-scaled-e1706540422969.jpg\",\"keywords\":[\"Book of James\",\"Justification\",\"Law\",\"Martin Luther\",\"works righteousness\"],\"articleSection\":[\"Authority of Scripture\",\"Bible Difficulties\",\"Justification\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com\\/is-the-book-of-james-really-an-epistle-of-straw\\/\",\"name\":\"Is the Book of James Really 