        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>RTS Charlotte 2023 Year in Review - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/rts-charlotte-2023-year-in-review/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"RTS Charlotte 2023 Year in Review - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Well, it’s New Year’s Eve. It’s the time of the year to be inundated with “Best of” stories and “Year in Review” segments, dutifully cataloging everything that happened in pop culture or politics. But, what if a “Year in Review” was about more than celebrities or sports teams? What if we did a year in [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://canonfodder.wpenginepowered.com/rts-charlotte-2023-year-in-review/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-12-31T14:10:26+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-12-31T14:11:42+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2023/12/2023-scaled.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2560\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"2357\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+js