        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>A Focused Method for Discussions with Jehovah&#039;s Witnesses - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/jehovahs-witnesses/a-focused-method-for-discussions-with-jehovahs-witnesses/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Focused Method for Discussions with Jehovah&#039;s Witnesses - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Introduction It is always helpful to have a plan for when Jehovah&#8217;s Witnesses come knocking at your door. Something that has always resonated with me is hearing James White say that we should try to keep the conversation focused on one topic. All too often we will want to talk about John 1:1 or failed prophecy (after prophecy, after prophecy). [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/jehovahs-witnesses/a-focused-method-for-discussions-with-jehovahs-witnesses/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-05-16T13:14:25+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2026-05-16T13:14:27+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Chris Whisonant\" />\n<meta name=\