        "title": {
          "rendered": "The Descent of CNism into the World of Candace Owens"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So on Christmas day Joel Webbon responded to a Christian woman by simply saying &#8220;Silence, Jew.  It&#8217;s Christmas.&#8221;  And so began another eruption of the degradation of CNism into just another &#8220;it&#8217;s the Jews&#8221; group, with Joel Webbon and Eric Conn leading the parade.  Hated to have to take the time to do it, but with Webbon doing a program with Nick Fuentes this weekend, it had to be done.  At least we can say we warned people in the past, and sadly, most of those warnings have gone unheeded.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/1230252054426667/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"The Descent of CNism into the World of Candace Owens\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5BzOsecxIzs?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>So on Christmas day Joel Webbon responded to a Christian woman by simply saying &#8220;Silence, Jew. It&#8217;s Christmas.&#8221; And so began another eruption of the degradation of CNism into just another &#8220;it&#8217;s the Jews&#8221; group, with Joel Webbon and Eric Conn leading the parade. Hated to have to take the time to do it, but with Webbon doing a program [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
