        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Holocaustianity? Really Joel? The Weirdness Continues, Plus a Little Soteriology101 - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/holocaustianity-really-joel-the-weirdness-continues-plus-a-little-soteriology101/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Holocaustianity? Really Joel? The Weirdness Continues, Plus a Little Soteriology101 - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I guess I had more stuff from Joel Webbon than I thought I did as I kept running into it as I looked through my bookmarks today and we kept circling back, my apologies! But, after talking about &#8220;Holocaustianity&#8221; we did get to some Provisionist stuff, though I didn&#8217;t get that finished up. Will do so next week, I hope. [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/holocaustianity-really-joel-the-weirdness-continues-plus-a-little-soteriology101/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-12-17T02:13:00+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-12-17T12:55:55+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png