        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Road Trip Dividing Line: Insane World Stuff, BishopJaxi&#039;s Self-Refuting Question - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/road-trip-dividing-line-insane-world-stuff-bishopjaxis-self-refuting-question/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Road Trip Dividing Line: Insane World Stuff, BishopJaxi&#039;s Self-Refuting Question - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Did the program live from Pryor, Oklahoma (it&#8217;s a bit nippy out here!). Covered some truly insane cultural items at the start, and then moved on to responding to @BishopJaxi&#8217;s attack on sola scriptura on X. Important material for folks wanting to provide sound responses to those seeking a form of the church that Christ never intended us to have.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/road-trip-dividing-line-insane-world-stuff-bishopjaxis-self-refuting-question/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-12-03T02:00:00+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twi