        "title": {
          "rendered": "Open Phones Dividing Line!"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Rich and I were commenting after the show, &#8220;Why don&#8217;t we do this more often?  That was great!&#8221;  Good calls on lots of topics as always.  Two were on Reformed Baptists in churches of another denomination (one Lutheran, one PCA).  Also calls on the early church writers, Mormonism, etc.  Enjoy!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/112025145585883/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Open Phones Dividing Line!\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/x41_Jf89F-M?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Rich and I were commenting after the show, &#8220;Why don&#8217;t we do this more often? That was great!&#8221; Good calls on lots of topics as always. Two were on Reformed Baptists in churches of another denomination (one Lutheran, one PCA). Also calls on the early church writers, Mormonism, etc. Enjoy!</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
