        "title": {
          "rendered": "Converts to Anglicanism, Response to Roman Catholic, Douthat and Wilson"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Everything sort of hooked up nicely today on the show, from talking about a Baptist converting to Anglicanism, into providing a response to a Roman Catholic on what true peace is (and how we obtain it) to my responding to Doug Wilson&#8217;s comments to Ross Douthat on what it means to be a Christian and whether Roman Catholicism presents, or obscures, that reality.  </p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/109251432583981/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Converts to Anglicanism, Response to Roman Catholic, Douthat and Wilson\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CwZUzruOpxw?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Everything sort of hooked up nicely today on the show, from talking about a Baptist converting to Anglicanism, into providing a response to a Roman Catholic on what true peace is (and how we obtain it) to my responding to Doug Wilson&#8217;s comments to Ross Douthat on what it means to be a Christian and whether Roman Catholicism presents, or [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
