        "title": {
          "rendered": "On The Road Dividing Line from Pennsylvania"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today I covered the last few days in light of the Charlie Kirk murder, talking about grief, martyrdom, assassination, and the foolishness of telling people they should leave their churches. I will confess, I wandered around a bit&#8212;should have put that outline together, but didn&#8217;t have time! Part of the &#8220;what you need to get done on the road&#8221; syndrome. But, hopefully helpful anyway!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/91725231122657/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"On The Road Dividing Line from Pennsylvania\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R4-D7LIEEqw?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Today I covered the last few days in light of the Charlie Kirk murder, talking about grief, martyrdom, assassination, and the foolishness of telling people they should leave their churches. I will confess, I wandered around a bit&#8212;should have put that outline together, but didn&#8217;t have time! Part of the &#8220;what you need to get done on the road&#8221; syndrome. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
