        "title": {
          "rendered": "Pre-Road Trip DL from the Mobile Command Center"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This was a hot program!  Mainly because the AC units had not yet caught up with the Arizona heat in the RV!  Anyway, talked about the sad state of affairs, worldview wise, on social media, then talked about what the Bible says about purity in speech.  Then we looked at a statement about the &#8220;Reformed Ghetto&#8221; from Joel Webbon and his view that Rome is not even in the top 50 issues to worry about today, and yet, how <em>glorious</em> &#8220;Christendom&#8221; once was!  The next program will definitely be from on the road as I depart on Saturday for Tennessee.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/828252128476023/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Pre-Road Trip DL from the Mobile Command Center\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9VM7FjIuYps?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
