        "title": {
          "rendered": "A Tale of Two Topics:  Assumed Unitarianism, More from David Allen"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Had to keep it to an hour today, but we started looking at some statements from Dale Tuggy in his debate from a number of years ago with Michael Brown in preparation for my second debate with Dale in Tullahoma next month.  Then we got back into David Allen&#8217;s new book as we move toward it&#8217;s attempt to deal with Romans 8.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/882501415012/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/yBk3ypaO_g8\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
