        "title": {
          "rendered": "Debate Stuff, Muhammed Under Fire, David Allen&#8217;s New Book"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Started off talking about exciting news about a new upcoming debate, and that it <em>should</em> be the big #200! Then switched over to some Islamic topics regarding whether Muhammed existed and the debate about that amongst Christians working in the field.  Then we took a look at some material from David Allen&#8217;s new book and demonstrated that, once again, the text of Scripture, and the Text of David, are often two different things.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/72925232183037/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/evScaq8zT38\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
