        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Catching Up on a Bunch of Articles and Memes - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/catching-up-on-a-bunch-of-articles-and-memes/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Catching Up on a Bunch of Articles and Memes - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Covered the gamut today, starting off with some prayer requests, then talking about kids playing games on the Internet, then looking at a false allegation of &#8220;solo Scriptura,&#8221; John 6 from a Roman Catholic perspective, and I finished up with a spiritual application of recent events in the life of a little feral kitty named Boo Mamma.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/catching-up-on-a-bunch-of-articles-and-memes/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-06-20T02:00:00+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"James White\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-gra