        "title": {
          "rendered": "HB25-1312 in Colorado, Debating Wolfe, Purgatory, Marian Dogmas"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Played J. Chase Davis&#8217; testimony before the Colorado State Senate on the program today regarding the tyrannical and ethically insane HB25-1312 legislation pending up there.  May God protect Colorado from this evil!  Then I talked about everyone saying I am supposed to be debating Stephen Wolfe, and what we would debate about anyway, then we talked a bit about purgatory, and finally the idea of Mary as &#8220;the Mother of God.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/51252224564436/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"HB25-1312 in Colorado, Debating Wolfe, Purgatory, Marian Dogmas\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iE5hjB_pF6E?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Played J. Chase Davis&#8217; testimony before the Colorado State Senate on the program today regarding the tyrannical and ethically insane HB25-1312 legislation pending up there. May God protect Colorado from this evil! Then I talked about everyone saying I am supposed to be debating Stephen Wolfe, and what we would debate about anyway, then we talked a bit about purgatory, [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
