        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spent most of the hour talking about the edits that went into the 2025 update of the ESV, though that is not the most exciting topic to be addressing!  This will be the last &#8220;regular&#8221; DL for a while as I head out on the road next week, so grab the AO App so you can get notifications about our upcoming Road Trip DLs!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/2142503872869/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
