        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/that-weird-pointy-hat-procession-then-stephen-wolfes-smarter-worldview/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "That Weird Pointy Hat Procession, then, Stephen Wolfe&#8217;s Smarter Worldview"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Went for a jumbo edition today in the big studio with the big board!  Commented briefly about the Roman Catholic penitential procession video that made the rounds a few days ago, then we looked at Stephen Wolfe&#8217;s lengthy tweet about the term &#8220;worldview&#8221; and how we would be better off abandoning it. Hardly surprising, but I disagreed!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/2525034576399/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"That Weird Pointy Hat Procession, then, Stephen Wolfe&#039;s Smarter Worldview\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xkf8mygwdL4?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Went for a jumbo edition today in the big studio with the big board! Commented briefly about the Roman Catholic penitential procession video that made the rounds a few days ago, then we looked at Stephen Wolfe&#8217;s lengthy tweet about the term &#8220;worldview&#8221; and how we would be better off abandoning it. Hardly surprising, but I disagreed!</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
