          "rendered": "Wes Huff on Rogan, Sufficiency of Scripture, Some Calvin Robinson"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A number of items on the table today including some words from Mel Gibson about the Pope, a discussion of Wes Huff on Rogan, the sufficiency of Scripture, and some more statements from Calvin Robinson prompting us to again ask Joel Webbon whether he would allow Robinson to commit trashworld to the Immaculate Heart of Mary.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/110252355111235/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>A number of items on the table today including some words from Mel Gibson about the Pope, a discussion of Wes Huff on Rogan, the sufficiency of Scripture, and some more statements from Calvin Robinson prompting us to again ask Joel Webbon whether he would allow Robinson to commit trashworld to the Immaculate Heart of Mary.</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
