          "rendered": "<p>Exactly one month ago, I published a TGC article on the recently discovered &#8216;gospel&#8217; manuscript from Oxyrhynchus, P.Oxy. 5575. This new manuscript is noteworthy for many reasons (which I cover in the article), but mostly because it includes material from the Gospel of Thomas laid alongside material from Matthew and Luke. While such a discovery [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
