          "og_title": "What I’ll Be Up to at the TGC National Conference - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Next week, Sept 25-27 th , I’ll be headed to Indianapolis to participate in The Gospel Coalition National  Conference entitled, “Hope in the Wilderness.” The conference this year is unique because TGC is partnering with other organizations to offer “micro events.” These are sort of like smaller conferences within the larger conference. So, while TGC [&hellip;]",
