    {
      "source": "kruger",
      "sourceId": "13646",
      "title": "Are Christians Allowed to Doubt? My Conversation with Josh Chatraw",
      "author": "Danielle Belcher",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/are-christians-allowed-to-doubt-my-conversation-with-josh-chatraw/",
      "sha256": "056aa6a3f277df28a21af2a81b5922de446c18770790f2e3ff63068bda7a10a0",
      "bytes": 2311,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\13646.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:13:05.353430+00:00",
      "language": "en",
      "audience": "adult readers; pastors; scholars",
      "campaignMission": "RB08",
      "licence": "Copyright retained by author/ministry; publicly offered written material; private local research copy; original notices and credits retained",
      "useScope": "private local import and embedding",
      "contributor": "Danielle Belcher",
      "credit": "kruger",
      "sourceApi": "https://michaeljkruger.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts?per_page=100&page=2",
      "sourceMetadata": {
        "id": 13646,
        "date": "2023-08-28T09:04:09",
        "date_gmt": "2023-08-28T13:04:09",
        "guid": {
          "rendered": "http://michaeljkruger.com/?p=13646"
        },
        "modified": "2023-10-06T05:48:19",
        "modified_gmt": "2023-10-06T09:48:19",
        "slug": "are-christians-allowed-to-doubt-my-conversation-with-josh-chatraw",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://michaeljkruger.com/are-christians-allowed-to-doubt-my-conversation-with-josh-chatraw/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "Are Christians Allowed to Doubt? My Conversation with Josh Chatraw"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At the inaugural&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/thekellercenter/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Keller Center</a>&nbsp;gathering last spring, I got together with Josh Chatraw, Billy Graham Chair of Evangelism at Beeson Divinity School, to discuss this important issue of doubt in the Christian life. The video of our conversation is below.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Both of us have written on the subject. Josh has recently released an entire book on the topic along with Jack Carson,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://amzn.to/3PedoiT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Surprised by Doubt: How Disillusionment Can Invite Us into a Deeper Faith</em>&nbsp;</a>(Brazos, 2023).&nbsp; And I have written on this topic here and there throughout my book,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://amzn.to/45LsMcX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Surviving Religion 101: Letters to a Christian Student on Keeping the Faith in College</em></a>&nbsp;(Crossway, 2021).</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As an additional note, both of us are speaking on the topic of doubt at the forthcoming&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/tgc23/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">TGC 23 National Conference</a>, Sept 25-27.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy the conversation!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Q6ROBZDGyGY?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>At the inaugural&nbsp;Keller Center&nbsp;gathering last spring, I got together with Josh Chatraw, Billy Graham Chair of Evangelism at Beeson Divinity School, to discuss this important issue of doubt in the Christian life. The video of our conversation is below. Both of us have written on the subject. Josh has recently released an entire book on [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
