      "title": "How Did We Get the Bible?",
      "author": "Danielle Belcher",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/how-did-we-get-the-bible-2/",
      "sha256": "ef323cb6fe323dc6e902d66e09f34ac1fc5d781ebac94aadb928948f0d946d89",
