        "modified": "2023-11-22T01:56:32",
        "modified_gmt": "2023-11-22T06:56:32",
        "slug": "how-did-we-get-the-bible-2",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://michaeljkruger.com/how-did-we-get-the-bible-2/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "How Did We Get the Bible?"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I recently did a weekend conference for <a href=\"https://christcovenant.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Christ Covenant Church in Atlanta, GA</a>, on the topic of where the Bible came from, and why we can trust it. Here&#8217;s a video of my lecture, followed by a video of an interview I did with Jason Dees, the senior pastor of Christ Covenant. Enjoy!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vPUBjRxDQXo?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;start=1088&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5MPb8gFsLNE?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>I recently did a weekend conference for Christ Covenant Church in Atlanta, GA, on the topic of where the Bible came from, and why we can trust it. Here&#8217;s a video of my lecture, followed by a video of an interview I did with Jason Dees, the senior pastor of Christ Covenant. Enjoy!</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
