          "og_title": "My Tribute to Tim Keller - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "By now, you have heard the sad news. Tim Keller has just passed away. I still remember the first time I heard a Tim Keller sermon. It was the mid-90’s, and I happened to be in New York City. Having just graduated from seminary, I had heard all the buzz about this new pastor in [&hellip;]",
