          "og_title": "6 Ways Christian Students Can Prepare for College: #6 Stick Together Like a Band of Brothers (or Sisters) - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Over the last few months I have been working through a&nbsp;6-part series&nbsp;helping Christian students think through how to prepare for life at a big university. This topic is particularly relevant, I hope, given the number of high school seniors who are in the middle of deciding where they will go to college in the fall. [&hellip;]",
