      "source": "kruger",
      "sourceId": "13098",
      "title": "6 Ways that Christian Students Can Prepare for College: #4 People Don’t Believe Things Simply Because of the Facts",
      "author": "Danielle Belcher",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/6-ways-that-christian-students-can-prepare-for-college-4-people-dont-believe-things-simply-because-of-the-facts/",
      "sha256": "dbf6b9ac0fb647437ad05321f80a2a197d001b1f56e8ae091412f8043d4ddd2e",
