          "og_description": "Well, it&#8217;s that time of year. By now, many high school seniors have heard where they have been accepted to college. Others are still waiting. But all are beginning to think about the next stage of their life post-high school. And for Christian students this time of anticipation can be particularly acute. It is natural [&hellip;]",
