      "title": "Here’s Why I Wrote My New Book, “Bully Pulpit”",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/heres-why-i-wrote-my-new-book-bully-pulpit/",
      "sha256": "a0f4c25252271eec48054532eb50c8c6d1a6e5ac589fd9c1e1da0e0330f8df7d",
      "bytes": 2985,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\10278.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:13:06.964438+00:00",
      "language": "en",
      "audience": "adult readers; pastors; scholars",
