      "sourceApi": "https://michaeljkruger.com/wp-json/wp/v2/posts?per_page=100&page=2",
      "sourceMetadata": {
        "id": 10278,
        "date": "2023-02-20T08:53:29",
        "date_gmt": "2023-02-20T13:53:29",
        "guid": {
          "rendered": "http://michaeljkruger.com/?p=10278"
        },
        "modified": "2023-04-14T18:07:39",
        "modified_gmt": "2023-04-14T22:07:39",
        "slug": "heres-why-i-wrote-my-new-book-bully-pulpit",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://michaeljkruger.com/heres-why-i-wrote-my-new-book-bully-pulpit/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "Here&#8217;s Why I Wrote My New Book, &#8220;Bully Pulpit&#8221;"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4150CrL\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"9882\" data-permalink=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/books/bully-pulpit-book-cover/\" data-orig-file=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/08/Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"680,1035\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/08/Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover.jpg\" class=\"alignright wp-image-9882\" src=\"https://michaeljkruger.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover-400x609.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"226\" height=\"344\" srcset=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/08/Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover-400x609.jpg 400w, https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/08/Bully-Pulpit-Book-Cover.jpg 680w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 226px) 100vw, 226px\" /></a>Since the release of my new book, <a href=\"https://amzn.to/4150CrL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Bully Pulpit: Confronting the Problem of </em></a><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4150CrL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Spiritual Abuse in the Church</em></a> (Zondervan, 2022), I have done a ton of podcasts. Some of the most enjoyable have been with Collin Hansen at <a href=\"https://youtu.be/STzYvDhKLm4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gospelbound</a> podcast, Warren Cole Smith at <a href=\"https://wng.org/podcasts/a-conversation-with-michael-kruger-s11-e5-1666932305\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">World Magazine</a>, and Sean McDowell and Scott Rae at <a href=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2023/02/confronting-spiritual-abuse-with-michael-kruger-1.mp3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Think Biblically</em> </a>podcast.</p>\n<p>But in nearly all these podcasts, the first question I get is: &#8220;Why in the world did you, as a NT scholar, write a book about spiritual abuse?&#8221;  And that&#8217;s a fair question. Nearly all my prior publications have been fairly academic and mostly on text/canon issues.</p>\n<p>So, here&#8217;s a video giving my answer to this question!</p>\n<p><iframe title=\"&quot;Bully Pulpit&quot; Dr. Mike Kruger\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/792258548?dnt=1&amp;app_id=122963\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\"></iframe></p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>&nbsp; Since the release of my new book, Bully Pulpit: Confronting the Problem of Spiritual Abuse in the Church (Zondervan, 2022), I have done a ton of podcasts. Some of the most enjoyable have been with Collin Hansen at Gospelbound podcast, Warren Cole Smith at World Magazine, and Sean McDowell and Scott Rae at Think [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
