        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Here&#039;s Why I Wrote My New Book, &quot;Bully Pulpit&quot; - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/heres-why-i-wrote-my-new-book-bully-pulpit/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Here&#039;s Why I Wrote My New Book, &quot;Bully Pulpit&quot; - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&nbsp; Since the release of my new book, Bully Pulpit: Confronting the Problem of Spiritual Abuse in the Church (Zondervan, 2022), I have done a ton of podcasts. Some of the most enjoyable have been with Collin Hansen at Gospelbound podcast, Warren Cole Smith at World Magazine, and Sean McDowell and Scott Rae at Think [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/heres-why-i-wrote-my-new-book-bully-pulpit/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-02-20T13:53:29+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:07:39+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/12/Bully-Pulpit-cover-e1670249189873.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"528\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\