        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Do the Synoptic Gospels Portray Jesus as God? Rethinking Jesus Walking on the Water - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/do-the-synoptic-gospels-portray-jesus-as-god-rethinking-jesus-walking-on-the-water/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Do the Synoptic Gospels Portray Jesus as God? Rethinking Jesus Walking on the Water - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"If I&#8217;ve heard it once, I&#8217;ve heard it a thousand times. It&#8217;s the idea that John presents Jesus as divine and the Synoptic Gospels (Matthew, Mark, and Luke) present Jesus as a mere man. And when you combine all the Gospels together, only then do you end up with a vision of Jesus as both [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/do-the-synoptic-gospels-portray-jesus-as-god-rethinking-jesus-walking-on-the-water/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-02-06T14:47:29+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-09-05T13:42:10+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2023/02/water-scaled-e1675694538136.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"652\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twit