          "og_title": "When Were Christians First Regarded as Intolerant \"Haters\"? - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "In the midst of the high octane culture wars of the last ten years, Christians have been labelled all sorts of things: intolerant, bigoted, arrogant, narrow, dogmatic, just to name a few. But, one noteworthy word stands out. Christians have been labelled haters.  Despite the fact that Christians are to be known by their love [&hellip;]",
