          "og_title": "RTS Charlotte 2022 Year in Review - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Well, it’s New Year’s Eve.  It’s the time of the year to be inundated with “Best of” stories and “Year in Review” segments, dutifully cataloging everything that happened in pop culture or politics. But, what if a “Year in Review” was about more than celebrities or sports teams? What if we did a year in [&hellip;]",
