        "title": {
          "rendered": "Road Trip DL from St. Charles"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Got a program in from windy, and soon to be <em>very</em> cold, St. Charles Missouri, where I will be speaking on God&#8217;s response to the LGBTQ revolution this weekend, the 24th year I have spoken at Covenant of Grace Church.  Talked a bit about &#8220;Reformedville&#8221; and happenings therein, eventually transitioning into the glorious truth of the sufficiency of Scripture from Luke 24.  May sneak another program in tomorrow, Lord willing, despite the fact that tomorrow here in St. Charles the high temperature will not make it above freezing!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/12424234242084/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Road Trip DL from St. Charles\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CI5J7X2hEFo?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Got a program in from windy, and soon to be very cold, St. Charles Missouri, where I will be speaking on God&#8217;s response to the LGBTQ revolution this weekend, the 24th year I have spoken at Covenant of Grace Church. Talked a bit about &#8220;Reformedville&#8221; and happenings therein, eventually transitioning into the glorious truth of the sufficiency of Scripture from [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
