        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Three sections to the program today. The first topic was a discussion on Romans 3 and its testimony to human sinfulness.  The second was a relatively brief commentary on new developments in the Steve Lawson saga.  The last was a discussion of the terms pietism, Anabaptism, and sacralism, prompted by a recent webcast that identified me as a pietist and an Anabaptist.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/926242022552520/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n",
          "protected": false
        },
