        "link": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/a-few-comments-on-the-lawson-issue-then-more-than-an-hour-in-response-to-sam-costner/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "A Few Comments on the Lawson Issue, Then More Than an Hour in Response to Sam Costner"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Couldn&#8217;t avoid a few brief comments on the Steve Lawson issue that came to light today at the start of the program. Then I read through an eleven tweet thread written by Samuel Costner back on 8/31 regarding the Crusaders and my supposedly abandoning the younger generation by refusing to go along with the lionization of these Roman Catholic military expeditions. Covered a lot of stuff including answering the question, &#8220;Well, if not the Crusaders, then who should we look up to?&#8221; and &#8220;What does it mean to fight for the Kingdom of God today?&#8221;  More than 90 minutes in length today.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/92024038133068/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"A Few Comments on the Lawson Issue, Then More Than an Hour in Response to Sam Costner\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MH9oscx7lOA?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Couldn&#8217;t avoid a few brief comments on the Steve Lawson issue that came to light today at the start of the program. Then I read through an eleven tweet thread written by Samuel Costner back on 8/31 regarding the Crusaders and my supposedly abandoning the younger generation by refusing to go along with the lionization of these Roman Catholic military [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
