      "title": "What Does It Mean To Be Winsomely Reformed?",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/what-does-it-mean-to-be-winsomely-reformed/",
      "sha256": "8ecd31d2b209b048e37106578bf932908b8e0c34a21e5e28585a151da2c5b127",
      "bytes": 8005,
