          "og_description": "Last week I announced the upcoming release of my new book, Bully Pulpit: Confronting the Problem of Spiritual Abuse in the Church (Zondervan, 2022). The book releases on November 1st. As a lead up to the book release, I am launching a new blog series entitled, &#8220;5 Misconceptions about Spiritual Abuse.&#8221;  In my research for the [&hellip;]",
