        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>John Owen&#039;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 6 - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/john-owen/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"John Owen&#039;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 6 - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"This is a follow up to the previous posts&nbsp;in this blog series&nbsp;where I will go through the works of John Owen detailing where he has mentioned Thomas Aquinas. I hope that this series is helpful. In this sixth part, I would like to finish looking at the mentions of Thomas Aquinas in the 7 Volumes of his &#8220;Exposition of the [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/john-owen/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-05-24T17:27:37+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-05-24T17:27:46+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Chris Whisonant\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Chris Whisonant\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"9 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Chris Whisonant\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/60cc3d867a8ec07651472bfae9b77395\"},\"headline\":\"John Owen&#8217;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 6\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-05-24T17:27:37+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-05-24T17:27:46+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/\"},\"wordCount\":1835,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"articleSection\":[\"Church History\",\"John Owen\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/\",\"name\":\"John Owen's Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 6 - Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\"},\"datePublished\":\"2024-05-24T17:27:37+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-05-24T17:27:46+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-6\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"John Owen&#8217;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 6\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"description\":\"Toward a Defense of the Faith\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"width\":257,\"height\":234,\"caption\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/aomin.org\",\"https:\\/\\/x.com\\/AominOrg\",\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/user\\/AominOrg\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/60cc3d867a8ec07651472bfae9b77395\",\"name\":\"Chris Whisonant\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"caption\":\"Chris Whisonant\"},\"description\":\"Currently Vice President of Alpha and Omega Ministries, Chris is a husband, father of two, and lay leader in a Baptistic Congregation in Georgia. He writes at cwhisonant.wordpress.com where his current focus is on Baptism in the Early Church, his adventures in reading through Augustine's works.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/cwhisonant.wordpress.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/author\\/cwhisonant\\/\"}]}</script>\n<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->",
