        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Jimmy Akin Debates Upcoming, then Open Phones - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Jimmy Akin Debates Upcoming, then Open Phones - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Spent a few minutes at the start predicting where the debates in a few weeks will go in Louisiana, then we started taking calls mainly on the topic of the five debates we did last month, hence discussions on the unitarianism debate, then moving on to the Flowers and Breda debates. Not sure when we will be doing another program, [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-04-03T04:30:00+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"James White\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"James White\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/ae536bcc768adace3c384b380f52ce6f\"},\"headline\":\"Jimmy Akin Debates Upcoming, then Open Phones\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-04-03T04:30:00+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/\"},\"wordCount\":91,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"articleSection\":[\"Debate\",\"Personal\",\"Provisionism\",\"Roman Catholicism\",\"The Dividing Line\",\"Unitarianism\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/\",\"name\":\"Jimmy Akin Debates Upcoming, then Open Phones - Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\"},\"datePublished\":\"2024-04-03T04:30:00+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/jimmy-akin-debates-upcoming-then-open-phones\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Jimmy Akin Debates Upcoming, then Open Phones\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"description\":\"Toward a Defense of the Faith\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"width\":257,\"height\":234,\"caption\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/aomin.org\",\"https:\\/\\/x.com\\/AominOrg\",\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/user\\/AominOrg\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/ae536bcc768adace3c384b380f52ce6f\",\"name\":\"James White\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/25fcac95b93fd59cc7111111a8413bcaa46cdfb6ba2767c6adc55360d276311f?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/25fcac95b93fd59cc7111111a8413bcaa46cdfb6ba2767c6adc55360d276311f?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/25fcac95b93fd59cc7111111a8413bcaa46cdfb6ba2767c6adc55360d276311f?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"caption\":\"James White\"},\"description\":\"James White is the director of Alpha and Omega Ministries, a Christian apologetics organization based in Phoenix, Arizona. He is the author of more than twenty four books, a professor, an accomplished debater.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/author\\/droakley\\/\"}]}</script>\n<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->",
