        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Christ is King, Yes, Yes He is! - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Christ is King, Yes, Yes He is! - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"After a quick update on our travel issues/situation, we started to comment on the &#8220;Christ is King&#8221; controversy, digging down a bit into the theology and context of the statement and what it means. We also looked at some folks claiming &#8220;replacement theology&#8221; (it&#8217;s fulfillment theology, but they don&#8217;t want to view it fairly) is actually heretical. Then we played [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-03-27T02:30:00+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Rich Pierce\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Rich Pierce\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Rich Pierce\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/a581be39cd8d2edaaf8722802b32b995\"},\"headline\":\"Christ is King, Yes, Yes He is!\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-03-27T02:30:00+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/\"},\"wordCount\":128,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"articleSection\":[\"Abortion\",\"Eschatology\",\"Personal\",\"Post-Evangelicalism\",\"Provisionism\",\"The Dividing Line\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/\",\"name\":\"Christ is King, Yes, Yes He is! - Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\"},\"datePublished\":\"2024-03-27T02:30:00+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/christ-is-king-yes-yes-he-is\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Christ is King, Yes, Yes He is!\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"description\":\"Toward a Defense of the Faith\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\",\"name\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2020\\/06\\/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\",\"width\":257,\"height\":234,\"caption\":\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/logo\\/image\\/\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/aomin.org\",\"https:\\/\\/x.com\\/AominOrg\",\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/user\\/AominOrg\"]},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/a581be39cd8d2edaaf8722802b32b995\",\"name\":\"Rich Pierce\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/efb3f3658d4d54c55099665dae05b8390611cb6e34162f28bcbc2806f4e7fd90?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/efb3f3658d4d54c55099665dae05b8390611cb6e34162f28bcbc2806f4e7fd90?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/efb3f3658d4d54c55099665dae05b8390611cb6e34162f28bcbc2806f4e7fd90?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"caption\":\"Rich Pierce\"},\"description\":\"Rich Pierce is the President of Alpha and Omega Ministries. Administration is Rich's primary responsibility here and it is his job to see to it that the day to day operations are taken care of so that Dr. White can remain focused on research and teaching. Rich came from the private sector after working as an administrator and eventually getting into computer support. Rich has been with Alpha and Omega Ministries originally in a volunteer capacity since 1987 and then became a full time employee in 1998. A native of Arizona, Rich grew up in Prescott and currently resides in Peoria. Rich is married with one son.\",\"sameAs\":[\"http:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/author\\/richpierce\\/\"}]}</script>\n<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->",
