        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/uncategorized/rv-news-then-hebrews-110-12-and-dale-tuggy/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "RV News, Then Hebrews 1:10-12 and Dale Tuggy"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Went over what has been going on over the past few days about our RV&#8212;and that fact that we needed to make arrangements to obtain a different one, due to it being defective and needing to be rebuilt. Went through the whole story, mainly for our supporters, as we will need to raise some funds to make up the differences in the trade-in, upgrading our hitch, etc., and all in a matter of weeks since I need to head out in about four weeks for the debates with Jimmy Akin in Louisiana. If you can help us, you can donate to the Travel Fund <a href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/support-us/\">here</a>.  Then we moved over to the Big Board and looked at Hebrews 1:10-12, and Dale Tuggy&#8217;s attempt to get away from its testimony to the deity of Christ.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/32024202231607/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"RV News, Then Hebrews 1:10-12 and Dale Tuggy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/00T93oYhAV0?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Went over what has been going on over the past few days about our RV&#8212;and that fact that we needed to make arrangements to obtain a different one, due to it being defective and needing to be rebuilt. Went through the whole story, mainly for our supporters, as we will need to raise some funds to make up the differences [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
