        "link": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/provisionist-mythology-refuted-with-full-documentation/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "Provisionist Mythology Refuted with Full Documentation"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spent two hours documenting the incredible mythology generated by Leighton Flowers and his guests regarding my supposed &#8220;Greek errors&#8221; over the past ten days.  Everyone who has heard the stories should watch, take notes, and verify for yourselves. Truly, the end of the story, and time to move on.  Hope you find it helpful!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/318242348555072/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Provisionist Mythology Refuted with Full Documentation\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/txdYLEmbrRE?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Spent two hours documenting the incredible mythology generated by Leighton Flowers and his guests regarding my supposed &#8220;Greek errors&#8221; over the past ten days. Everyone who has heard the stories should watch, take notes, and verify for yourselves. Truly, the end of the story, and time to move on. Hope you find it helpful!</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
