        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>John Owen&#039;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 4 - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/john-owen/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"John Owen&#039;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 4 - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"This is a follow up to Part 1, Part 2, and Part 3 in this blog series where I will go through the works of John Owen detailing where he has mentioned Thomas Aquinas. I hope that this series is helpful. In this fourth part, I would like to look at the mentions of Thomas Aquinas in Volume 14 of [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/john-owen/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-03-05T13:58:51+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-03-05T14:14:02+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Chris Whisonant\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Chris Whisonant\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"11 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Chris Whisonant\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/60cc3d867a8ec07651472bfae9b77395\"},\"headline\":\"John Owen&#8217;s Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 4\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-03-05T13:58:51+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-03-05T14:14:02+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/\"},\"wordCount\":2197,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"articleSection\":[\"Church History\",\"John Owen\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/\",\"name\":\"John Owen's Usage of Thomas Aquinas, Part 4 - Alpha and Omega Ministries\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#website\"},\"datePublished\":\"2024-03-05T13:58:51+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-03-05T14:14:02+00:00\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-usage-of-thomas-aquinas-part-4\\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/john-owen\\/john-owens-u