avatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/47c9bdfacd172b2f76fff2ad266b6999d98cbb0a9cf88792499b43aadc2de514?s=96&d=mm&r=pg\",\"caption\":\"Chris Whisonant\"},\"description\":\"Currently Vice President of Alpha and Omega Ministries, Chris is a husband, father of two, and lay leader in a Baptistic Congregation in Georgia. He writes at cwhisonant.wordpress.com where his current focus is on Baptism in the Early Church, his adventures in reading through Augustine's works.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https:\\/\\/cwhisonant.wordpress.com\"],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/author\\/cwhisonant\\/\"}]}</script>\n<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->",
