                  "caption": "Rich Pierce"
                },
                "description": "Rich Pierce is the President of Alpha and Omega Ministries. Administration is Rich's primary responsibility here and it is his job to see to it that the day to day operations are taken care of so that Dr. White can remain focused on research and teaching. Rich came from the private sector after working as an administrator and eventually getting into computer support. Rich has been with Alpha and Omega Ministries originally in a volunteer capacity since 1987 and then became a full time employee in 1998. A native of Arizona, Rich grew up in Prescott and currently resides in Peoria. Rich is married with one son.",
