        "title": {
          "rendered": "Pre-Debate Road Trip Dividing Line from Houston"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Talked a little about the &#8220;He Gets Us&#8221; thing, gave a brief report on the <em>Allie Beth Stuckey Show</em> from Tuesday, then dove into the <em>Protevangelium of James</em> and read its narrative of the birth of Christ in light of the defense of this document as containing genuine Christian tradition by Roman Catholic apologists. We then moved on to discuss <em>The Invention of the Inspired Text</em> by John Poirier and his actual goals in writing his book.  Don&#8217;t know when the next program will be as I will be heading off to Tullahoma next week for the <em>Why Calvinism</em> conference, a debate, etc.  Watch the app for announcements!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/215242055284927/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Pre-Debate Road Trip Dividing Line from Houston\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cpaxGYqK17Q?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Talked a little about the &#8220;He Gets Us&#8221; thing, gave a brief report on the Allie Beth Stuckey Show from Tuesday, then dove into the Protevangelium of James and read its narrative of the birth of Christ in light of the defense of this document as containing genuine Christian tradition by Roman Catholic apologists. We then moved on to discuss [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
