        "title": {
          "rendered": "Road Trip DL: Francis, Cernovich, then Back to Carl Trueman and Development of Doctrinal Expression"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Back to on-the-road status for the program today!  We covered what&#8217;s going on tomorrow and in the upcoming days, then looked at a tweet from @Cernovich wherein he demonstrates he has never done serious reading in the topic, and then finished up the hour looking at a key section from Carl Trueman&#8217;s presentation (which we began reviewing over the past few weeks).</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/212242240800/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Road Trip DL: Francis, Cernovich, then Back to Carl Trueman and Development of Doctrinal Expression\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EuvuZj_b_LE?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Back to on-the-road status for the program today! We covered what&#8217;s going on tomorrow and in the upcoming days, then looked at a tweet from @Cernovich wherein he demonstrates he has never done serious reading in the topic, and then finished up the hour looking at a key section from Carl Trueman&#8217;s presentation (which we began reviewing over the past [&hellip;]</p>\n",
