        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Road Trip DL: Francis, Cernovich, then Back to Carl Trueman and Development of Doctrinal Expression - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Road Trip DL: Francis, Cernovich, then Back to Carl Trueman and Development of Doctrinal Expression - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Back to on-the-road status for the program today! We covered what&#8217;s going on tomorrow and in the upcoming days, then looked at a tweet from @Cernovich wherein he demonstrates he has never done serious reading in the topic, and then finished up the hour looking at a key section from Carl Trueman&#8217;s presentation (which we began reviewing over the past [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-02-13T01:11:21+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-02-13T01:11:30+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"James White\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"James White\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/ae536bcc768adace3c384b380f52ce6f\"},\"headline\":\"Road Trip DL: Francis, Cernovich, then Back to Carl Trueman and Development of Doctrinal Expression\",\"datePublished\":\"2024-02-13T01:11:21+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2024-02-13T01:11:30+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression\\/\"},\"wordCount\":85,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/#organization\"},\"articleSection\":[\"Church Fathers\",\"Church History\",\"Homosexuality\",\"Personal\",\"Post-Evangelicalism\",\"Road Trip\",\"Roman Catholicism\",\"The Dividing Line\",\"Theology Matters\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.aomin.org\\/aoblog\\/the-dividing-line\\/road-trip-dl-francis-cernovich-then-back-to-carl-trueman-and-development-of-doctrinal-expression\\/\",\"name\":\"R