        "title": {
          "rendered": "A Little Bit on Infants, a Little Bit on Alistair, the Rest with More Carl Trueman"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Covered a number of topics today with a short discussion of how a small number of ne&#8217;er-do-wells can create faux controversies for not positive reason, then talked a bit about Alistair Begg&#8217;s &#8220;swing and a miss&#8221; response, and then got back to Carl Trueman&#8217;s speech on classical theology.  An hour and fifteen minutes today.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/130242056384780/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"A Little Bit on Infants, a Little Bit on Alistair, the Rest with More Carl Trueman\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SK_7OmDOg2A?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Covered a number of topics today with a short discussion of how a small number of ne&#8217;er-do-wells can create faux controversies for not positive reason, then talked a bit about Alistair Begg&#8217;s &#8220;swing and a miss&#8221; response, and then got back to Carl Trueman&#8217;s speech on classical theology. An hour and fifteen minutes today.</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
