        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>A Little Bit on Infants, a Little Bit on Alistair, the Rest with More Carl Trueman - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/church-history/a-little-bit-on-infants-a-little-bit-on-alistair-the-rest-with-more-carl-trueman/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Little Bit on Infants, a Little Bit on Alistair, the Rest with More Carl Trueman - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Covered a number of topics today with a short discussion of how a small number of ne&#8217;er-do-wells can create faux controversies for not positive reason, then talked a bit about Alistair Begg&#8217;s &#8220;swing and a miss&#8221; response, and then got back to Carl Trueman&#8217;s speech on classical theology. An hour and fifteen minutes today.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/church-history/a-little-bit-on-infants-a-little-bit-on-alistair-the-rest-with-more-carl-trueman/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-01-31T02:49:19+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-01-31T02:49:27+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" /