        "title": {
          "rendered": "Lots of Short Topics, Andrew Fuller and the Reality of Death, then Back to Carl Trueman"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Touched on a bunch of topics from Texas to Alistair Begg to the United Methodists at the start.  Commented briefly on some miserable souls on line who want to debate about infant damnation. Then read from Nettle&#8217;s fine work on Andrew Fuller and the reality of death and how it impacts us and our theological outlook, before moving briefly back to Carl Trueman&#8217;s presentation that we began examining on the last DL.  90 minutes today.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/125241325484061/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Lots of Short Topics, Andrew Fuller and the Reality of Death, then Back to Carl Trueman\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JxWOuAD_-1E?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Touched on a bunch of topics from Texas to Alistair Begg to the United Methodists at the start. Commented briefly on some miserable souls on line who want to debate about infant damnation. Then read from Nettle&#8217;s fine work on Andrew Fuller and the reality of death and how it impacts us and our theological outlook, before moving briefly back [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
