        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Started off looking at Francis&#8217; comment that he hopes hell is empty, and what this would mean to Roman Catholic theology as a whole.  Then we transitioned over a Brandan Robertson video in which he shreds the Bible into contradictory strands, something that is all too common in what is called the &#8220;Christian academy.&#8221;</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/116242218403798/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Francis&#039; Empty Hell, Brandan&#039;s Empty Bible\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BVqPf5pXkJM?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
