        "title": {
          "rendered": "The Revealed God with Jeffrey Johnson; Stephen Wolfe&#8217;s 2024 Resolutions"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spent an hour and 15 minutes with Dr. Jeffery Johnson, President of GBTS, talking about his new book, <em><a href=\"https://freegracepress.com/products/the-revealed-god\">The Revealed God</a></em> (2023). Then I responded to a tweet storm from Stephen Wolfe just this morning and talked a bit about what it means to be &#8220;truly Reformed.&#8221;  An hour and 45 minutes.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/1424211945835/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"The Revealed God with Jeffrey Johnson; Stephen Wolfe&#039;s 2024 Resolutions\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LNigy99VTTo?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Spent an hour and 15 minutes with Dr. Jeffery Johnson, President of GBTS, talking about his new book, The Revealed God (2023). Then I responded to a tweet storm from Stephen Wolfe just this morning and talked a bit about what it means to be &#8220;truly Reformed.&#8221; An hour and 45 minutes.</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
