        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>The Revealed God with Jeffrey Johnson; Stephen Wolfe&#039;s 2024 Resolutions - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/the-revealed-god-with-jeffrey-johnson-stephen-wolfes-2024-resolutions/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Revealed God with Jeffrey Johnson; Stephen Wolfe&#039;s 2024 Resolutions - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Spent an hour and 15 minutes with Dr. Jeffery Johnson, President of GBTS, talking about his new book, The Revealed God (2023). Then I responded to a tweet storm from Stephen Wolfe just this morning and talked a bit about what it means to be &#8220;truly Reformed.&#8221; An hour and 45 minutes.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/the-revealed-god-with-jeffrey-johnson-stephen-wolfes-2024-resolutions/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2024-01-05T03:16:03+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-01-05T03:16:12+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" co