-book-bully-pulpit-confronting-the-problem-of-spiritual-abuse-in-the-church\\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.com\\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Announcing My New Book: Bully Pulpit: Confronting the Problem of Spiritual Abuse in the Church\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/\",\"name\":\"Canon Fodder\",\"description\":\"Exploring the origins of the New Testament canon and other biblical and theological issues\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":[\"Person\",\"Organization\"],\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\",\"name\":\"Michael Kruger\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/1043b2626d09a86949b484c40b96cbb282d55bfd715a25c59426facc6950c87f?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/1043b2626d09a86949b484c40b96cbb282d55bfd715a25c59426facc6950c87f?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/1043b2626d09a86949b484c40b96cbb282d55bfd715a25c59426facc6950c87f?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\",\"caption\":\"Michael Kruger\"},\"logo\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/secure.gravatar.com\\/avatar\\/1043b2626d09a86949b484c40b96cbb282d55bfd715a25c59426facc6950c87f?s=96&d=identicon&r=g\"},\"sameAs\":[\"http:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.com\"]}]}</script>\n<!-- / Yoast SEO plugin. -->",
