        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Rutgers&#039; Racist Professor, More Muhammed Hijab, and the Neo-Socinian Nonsense Again - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/rutgers-racist-professor-more-muhammed-hijab-and-the-neo-socinian-nonsense-again/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Rutgers&#039; Racist Professor, More Muhammed Hijab, and the Neo-Socinian Nonsense Again - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Back in Phoenix in our regular studio, so we looked briefly at the racist Rutgers professor and &#8220;white folks,&#8221; then we spent about twenty minutes responding to more of Muhammed Hijab&#8217;s opening statement against the Trinity, and then listened to a few minutes of the &#8220;Coffee House Sessions&#8221; webcast on the modern state of Reformed Baptist and Robert Briggs&#8217; accusation [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/rutgers-racist-professor-more-muhammed-hijab-and-the-neo-socinian-nonsense-again/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-12-15T03:10:49+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-12-15T03:10:58+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height