          "rendered": "<p>Well it&#8217;s that time of year. This Friday we will graduate another class of seminary students at RTS Charlotte, sending them off to serve the Lord in a variety of ways.  And during each of these graduations, I have an opportunity to give a final &#8220;charge&#8221; as the president of the campus. This year, I [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
