          "og_description": "Ok, so I am biased. Let me just get it out there. But, that doesn&#8217;t change the fact that my wife Melissa&#8217;s new kids book, His Grace is Enough: How God Makes It Right When We&#8217;ve Got it Wrong (Good Book Company, 2022), is really something special. It released yesterday, and I could not be [&hellip;]",
