        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Is the Concept of a &quot;Self-Authenticating&quot; Bible a Modern Invention? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-concept-of-a-self-authenticating-bible-a-modern-invention/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Is the Concept of a &quot;Self-Authenticating&quot; Bible a Modern Invention? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"How do we know which books are from God, and which are not?  Certainly the apostolic origins of a book can help identify it as being from God (see post here). And, the church’s overall consensus on a book can be part of how we identity it as being from God (see post here). But, [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-concept-of-a-self-authenticating-bible-a-modern-invention/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2022-04-25T13:56:10+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:03:24+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2021/09/man-praying-2-scaled-e1633005872551.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"519\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter