          "og_title": "Is the Concept of a \"Self-Authenticating\" Bible a Modern Invention? - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "How do we know which books are from God, and which are not?  Certainly the apostolic origins of a book can help identify it as being from God (see post here). And, the church’s overall consensus on a book can be part of how we identity it as being from God (see post here). But, [&hellip;]",
