        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Speaking the Truth in Love - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/speaking-the-truth-in-love/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Speaking the Truth in Love - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"When it comes to today&#8217;s volatile and divided ministry environment, these words stand out as particularly relevant: &#8220;Speak the truth in love&#8221; (Eph 4:15). Some conversations have a lot of truth but very little love. Other conversations have a lot love and affection, but very little truth. The biblical ideal is that we have both [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/speaking-the-truth-in-love/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2022-03-07T13:05:07+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:03:26+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2022/03/words-scaled-e1646332242631.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"515\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"5 minutes\" />\n<script type=\"ap