        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>What is &quot;Progressive&quot; Christianity? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-is-progressive-christianity/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What is &quot;Progressive&quot; Christianity? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"One of the benefits of studying church history is that you realize that Solomon was right: &#8220;There is nothing new under the sun&#8221; (Eccl 1:9). This proverb has certainly been proven true when it comes to different &#8220;versions&#8221; of Christianity that have popped up throughout the life of the church. In every generation it seems [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-is-progressive-christianity/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2022-02-28T13:51:49+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:03:27+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2018/04/Rembrandt31-e1523023102872.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"821\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"399\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data