        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Just a few brief comments on Catholicism at the start, then back to Hebrews and Jared&#8217;s article.  We are, at least, getting into the nitty gritty of what the real issues are, so, I hope that is helpful.  Tomorrow is a travel day for me, so I won&#8217;t be able to do another program until I am headed home next week, and those will be later in the day since I have 6+ hours to drive each day.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/12823050253630/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Poor Jared...Yes, Back to the Response\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kmtcxa0pdKo?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Just a few brief comments on Catholicism at the start, then back to Hebrews and Jared&#8217;s article. We are, at least, getting into the nitty gritty of what the real issues are, so, I hope that is helpful. Tomorrow is a travel day for me, so I won&#8217;t be able to do another program until I am headed home next [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
