        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>A Little Francis, But Mainly Responding to Jared Longshore - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/church-history/a-little-francis-but-mainly-responding-to-jared-longshore/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Little Francis, But Mainly Responding to Jared Longshore - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Commented on the Pope&#8217;s continued promotion of the climate fraud, and his connecting it to &#8220;the culture of death,&#8221; but spent most of the time responding to Jared Longshore on the Hebrews 8 issue. Did not finish, but hope to later in the week. Asked for comments on Twitter from listeners as to whether you want more of this kind [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/church-history/a-little-francis-but-mainly-responding-to-jared-longshore/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-12-05T00:17:50+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-12-07T03:54:28+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" conte