        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Romans, the &quot;Righteousness of God,&quot; and the 1984 NIV - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Romans, the &quot;Righteousness of God,&quot; and the 1984 NIV - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I was recently on the Knowing Faith podcast with Jen Wilkin, J.T. English, and Kyle Worley. We had a great time focusing on some of my favorite verses in the Bible, Romans 3:21-26.  Martin Luther called those verses, “The chief point, and the very central place of the Epistle, and of the whole Bible.” This [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-10-28T14:13:53+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:02:23+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2021/10/NIV-1984-scaled-e1635430222193.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"486\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"1 minute\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"Michael Kruger\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"headline\":\"Romans, the &#8220;Righteousness of God,&#8221; and the 1984 NIV\",\"datePublished\":\"2021-10-28T14:13:53+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2023-04-14T22:02:23+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/\"},\"wordCount\":596,\"commentCount\":9,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/#\\/schema\\/person\\/b985803864f1d81b09c01a0aa8aa6d22\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\/\\/5mt.michaeljkruger.com\\/2021\\/10\\/NIV-1984-scaled-e1635430222193.jpg\",\"keywords\":[\"1984 NIV\",\"Justification\",\"Righteousness of God\",\"Romans\"],\"articleSection\":[\"Bible Difficulties\",\"Justification\",\"Reformed Theology\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/romans-the-righteousness-of-god-and-the-1984-niv\\/\",\"name\":\"Romans, the \\\"Righteousness of God,\\\" and the 1984 NIV - Canon Fodder\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/m