        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>A Key Sign You are Maturing as a Preacher - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/a-key-sign-you-are-maturing-as-a-preacher/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"A Key Sign You are Maturing as a Preacher - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"As a seminary professor (and a pastor) I spend a lot of time helping students grow and develop as preachers. After hearing a student preach, I will often get coffee or lunch with that student and we will discuss the strengths and weaknesses of the sermon and how it can be improved. Over the years, [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/a-key-sign-you-are-maturing-as-a-preacher/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-10-19T12:32:33+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:02:24+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2021/10/film-scaled-e1634646654341.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"598\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"3 minutes\" />\n<scrip