        "title": {
          "rendered": "Responding to a Roman Catholic Convert"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Though I touched briefly on a Soteriology 101 tweet at the end of the show, the vast majority was directed to responding to Joshua T. Charles and his presentation of Newman&#8217;s &#8220;development hypothesis&#8221; as the answer to my Nicea question.  A lot is going on in Rome these days, and we need to keep up if we wish to be good witnesses!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/1120232120212885/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Responding to a Roman Catholic Convert\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n-wN1DVgpCE?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Though I touched briefly on a Soteriology 101 tweet at the end of the show, the vast majority was directed to responding to Joshua T. Charles and his presentation of Newman&#8217;s &#8220;development hypothesis&#8221; as the answer to my Nicea question. A lot is going on in Rome these days, and we need to keep up if we wish to be [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
