        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Zach Lambert&#039;s Sermon Concluded - Alpha and Omega Ministries</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/zach-lamberts-sermon-concluded/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Zach Lambert&#039;s Sermon Concluded - Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Took two complete programs to do it, but we finished looking at Zach Lambert&#8217;s sermon on &#8220;Homophobia and Transphobia,&#8221; getting to the part where the Bible finally was referred to: and twisted into a pretzel. It is truly hard to listen to &#8220;progressivists&#8221; engage in societal eisegesis, but we sure got our fill in today&#8217;s 1:50 minute long program.\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/zach-lamberts-sermon-concluded/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Alpha and Omega Ministries\" />\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https://www.facebook.com/aomin.org\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-10-27T03:21:08+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-10-27T03:21:17+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/wp-content/uploads/2020/06/Logo-red-e1591639042841.png\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"257\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"234\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"James White\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Jame