        "title": {
          "rendered": "Doug Wilson&#8217;s Response to Riley, Taylor Marshall and Justification"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On the last program I said I hoped Doug Wilson would respond to Michael Riley&#8217;s article on a Van Tillian response to Christian Nationalism, and lo and behold, he did just that. So, we took the time to look it over and comment on it.  Then we looked at a Taylor Marshall tweet denying the imputed righteousness of Christ and dove into Romans 3-4 to respond.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/102023185162496/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Doug Wilson’s Response to Riley, Taylor Marshall and Justification\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/upiqYH0lICk?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>On the last program I said I hoped Doug Wilson would respond to Michael Riley&#8217;s article on a Van Tillian response to Christian Nationalism, and lo and behold, he did just that. So, we took the time to look it over and comment on it. Then we looked at a Taylor Marshall tweet denying the imputed righteousness of Christ and [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
