        "title": {
          "rendered": "SEALS Beat Biden, Michael Riley&#8217;s Post"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today we were joined by Asa Miller, former SEAL and one of the primary people in the <a href=\"https://youtu.be/p9euwl05sqo\">new documentary </a><em>SEALS Beat Biden</em> which comes out next month.  We talked about a lot of things, and it was an enjoyable conversation.  Then I went over <a href=\"https://g3min.org/not-by-what-standard-but-by-what-means/\">Michael Riley&#8217;s post</a> which appeared on the G3 website and I found most useful.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/1018232152202524/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"SEALS Beat Biden, Michael Riley’s Post\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XIMaVrfwV1c?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Today we were joined by Asa Miller, former SEAL and one of the primary people in the new documentary SEALS Beat Biden which comes out next month. We talked about a lot of things, and it was an enjoyable conversation. Then I went over Michael Riley&#8217;s post which appeared on the G3 website and I found most useful.</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
