        "title": {
          "rendered": "More on Relevant Islamic Beliefs, Response to Challenges from Islamic Debater"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Given the continuing conflict in the Middle East, we looked at the comments from the head of Hamas, looked at the concept of &#8220;the world at war&#8221; and &#8220;the world at peace,&#8221; and then worked through a short clip of a Muslim debater arguing against the clarity of the Christian Scriptures.  Then finished with a response to the explosion of amazing tweets and claims on Twitter since yesterday, including those saying I&#8217;ve been &#8220;bought off&#8221; by the &#8220;globalists&#8221; (yes, seriously, someone suggested that).</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/10122304157934/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"More on Relevant Islamic Beliefs, Response to Challenges from Islamic Debater\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RxQuLDph-zs?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
