        "title": {
          "rendered": "Back on the Road from Albuquerque: Reflections on a Quarter Century of Responding to Homosexual Argumentation"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I hot footed it over here to Albuquerque this morning to be on <em>Iron Sharpens Iron</em> with Chris Arnzen, and so I continued the topic (since it was on my mind) on this program. Looked at 1 Cor. 6 and Romans 1 and the entire &#8220;Side A/Side B&#8221; controversy.  Then briefly commented toward the end of Taylor Marshall&#8217;s comment about Augustine.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/9723014314956/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"On the Road from Albuquerque: Reflections on a 1/4 Century of Responding to Homosexual Argumentation\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/N7dhMM9CWWE?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>I hot footed it over here to Albuquerque this morning to be on Iron Sharpens Iron with Chris Arnzen, and so I continued the topic (since it was on my mind) on this program. Looked at 1 Cor. 6 and Romans 1 and the entire &#8220;Side A/Side B&#8221; controversy. Then briefly commented toward the end of Taylor Marshall&#8217;s comment about [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
