        "title": {
          "rendered": "90 Minutes of Open Phones on the Dividing Line"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I started off with a few comments on the coming mask mandates, etc.  Then, we took quite a variety of questions today from our callers! We discussed head coverings and Michael Heiser&#8217;s odd views on 1 Cor. 11; Hebrews 1:10 and its citation of Psalm 102; angels and demons today; how to translate the Greek term <strong>θέλω</strong> (<em>thelo</em>); and finally a discussion of justification, confession, and the Lord&#8217;s Supper.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/824231524242804/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"90 Minutes of Open Phones on the Dividing Line\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0Zsuh3fqBaU?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>I started off with a few comments on the coming mask mandates, etc. Then, we took quite a variety of questions today from our callers! We discussed head coverings and Michael Heiser&#8217;s odd views on 1 Cor. 11; Hebrews 1:10 and its citation of Psalm 102; angels and demons today; how to translate the Greek term θέλω (thelo); and finally [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
