        "title": {
          "rendered": "Conclusion of Response to Trent Horn, A Little Rosaria Butterfield"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Finished up our response to Trent Horn on the topic of <em>theopneustos</em>, which we began two programs ago.  But, I have started reading Rosaria Butterfield&#8217;s new book, <em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Five-Lies-Our-Anti-Christian-Age/dp/1433573539\"><strong>Five Lies of Our Anti-Christian Age</strong></a></em>, which is due to be released on September 12th, and I shared a few quotes and thoughts that are directly relevant to the debate in Manheim, PA, on September 16th.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/822232129584933/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Conclusion of Response to Trent Horn, A Little Rosaria Butterfield\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YGaxkKPAGXA?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Finished up our response to Trent Horn on the topic of theopneustos, which we began two programs ago. But, I have started reading Rosaria Butterfield&#8217;s new book, Five Lies of Our Anti-Christian Age, which is due to be released on September 12th, and I shared a few quotes and thoughts that are directly relevant to the debate in Manheim, PA, [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
