        "title": {
          "rendered": "Jumbo Dividing Line: Biblicism is the Road to Rome (Steve Meister)? Then Semantic Domains and Much More"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ninety minutes in the big studio today using the big board to look at some important topics.  Started off with a little KJV Only silliness, then a little TR-Only silliness, and then on to comments made by IRBC pastor Steve Meister on Josh Sommer&#8217;s program about biblicism being the &#8220;road to Rome.&#8221;  Having corrected that idea, we moved into the topic of Bible translation and the topic of semantic domains, <em>hapax legomenoi</em>, etc. </p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/83231814111689/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Jumbo Dividing Line: Biblicism is the Road to Rome (Steve Meister)? Then Semantic Domains &amp; More\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/US7fVZk7KN8?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Ninety minutes in the big studio today using the big board to look at some important topics. Started off with a little KJV Only silliness, then a little TR-Only silliness, and then on to comments made by IRBC pastor Steve Meister on Josh Sommer&#8217;s program about biblicism being the &#8220;road to Rome.&#8221; Having corrected that idea, we moved into the [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
