        "title": {
          "rendered": "Jason Wallace and Tobias Riemenschneider Guests: The Watertown Arrests"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Was joined by Pastor Jason Wallace for about forty minutes to talk about the new video he has produced, <em><a href=\"https://youtu.be/3AplWYXFiCA\">The Failure of Eastern Orthodoxy</a>.</em> Then Pastor Tobias Riemenschneider joined us from Germany to talk about his new book, <em><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Resisting-Tyranny-Christian-Government-Overreach/dp/1989169244\">Resisting Tyranny</a></em>.  Then I took a while to look at the <a href=\"https://republicsentinel.com/articles/it-was-worth-it-young-street-preacher-arrested-at-wisconsin-drag-event\">arrests of Christians</a> outside a sexual perversion event in Watertown, Wisconsin. </p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/8223330433204/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Jason Wallace and Tobias Riemenschneider Guests: The Watertown Arrests\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vHGLWuqPmoY?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Was joined by Pastor Jason Wallace for about forty minutes to talk about the new video he has produced, The Failure of Eastern Orthodoxy. Then Pastor Tobias Riemenschneider joined us from Germany to talk about his new book, Resisting Tyranny. Then I took a while to look at the arrests of Christians outside a sexual perversion event in Watertown, Wisconsin.</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
