        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Is the New Testament Really Filled with Contradictory Theologies? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-new-testament-really-filled-with-contradictory-theologies/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Is the New Testament Really Filled with Contradictory Theologies? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Perhaps no book in the history of the world has received as much scrutiny and criticism as the Bible.  For generations, scholars have picked apart every aspect of this book: its history, its transmission, its veracity, its theology, its morality, etc.  It has been criticized, ridiculed, mocked and condemned. Those who are in the academic [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-new-testament-really-filled-with-contradictory-theologies/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-04-20T12:30:08+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:01:36+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2021/04/Bible-3-scaled-e1618921370876.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"505\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Krug