      "title": "My New Book “Surviving Religion 101” Releases Today!",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/my-new-book-surviving-religion-101-releases-today/",
      "sha256": "34a8a290e9a0a89f1ab98343505300d51440da4d19765aca3729aa182175d8b6",
