        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Why Don&#039;t Churches Stop Spiritually Abusive Pastors? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/why-dont-churches-stop-spiritually-abusive-pastors/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Why Don&#039;t Churches Stop Spiritually Abusive Pastors? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"For the last couple of months I&#8217;ve been making my way through a blog series on spiritual abuse which I am calling “Bully Pulpit”.  You can see the prior installments here , here, here, and here. Part of the goal of this series has been to lead up to my session on spiritual abuse at [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/why-dont-churches-stop-spiritually-abusive-pastors/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-03-30T12:16:24+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:00:39+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2020/10/sheep-e1603209765620.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"467\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\