          "og_description": "&#8220;All who gain power are afraid to lose it.&#8221; So said Darth Sidious (aka, Chancellor Palpatine) in Star Wars: Revenge of the Sith. And despite being from the dark side, he was correct. The biggest motivator for those in power is often their fear of losing it. Sadly, that is also the case with abusive [&hellip;]",
