        "guid": {
          "rendered": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/?p=34255"
        },
        "modified": "2023-06-27T18:05:55",
        "modified_gmt": "2023-06-28T01:05:55",
        "slug": "road-trip-dl-from-santa-fe",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/road-trip-dl-from-santa-fe/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "Road Trip DL from Santa Fe"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Had to record the program today due to the location I am at in Santa Fe (possibly due to weather issues as well, not completely sure).  Talked about the Australian legislation being proposed to give the state pretty much full control over speech and how we have taken our eyes off the ball as the totalitarians continue their global march.  Then we switched over to a <a href=\"https://youtu.be/W-2yIIb9YCo\">discussion that took place last year</a> between William Lane Craig and unitarian Dale Tuggy.  We will be doing a deep dive on Tuggy&#8217;s claims and positions over the next number of weeks and months.  You might want to familiarize yourself with his views!  You might also want to see Michael Brown&#8217;s debate with Tuggy <a href=\"https://youtu.be/Oi300_FvFz0\">here</a>, and Chris Date&#8217;s interaction <a href=\"https://youtu.be/c35_uFjEbx8\">here</a>.  </p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/627231422361595/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Road Trip DL from Santa Fe\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4Zrii5or7MA?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Had to record the program today due to the location I am at in Santa Fe (possibly due to weather issues as well, not completely sure). Talked about the Australian legislation being proposed to give the state pretty much full control over speech and how we have taken our eyes off the ball as the totalitarians continue their global march. [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
