          "rendered": "Solo Flight #2: Christ&#8217;s Reign, Derek Webb&#8217;s Darkness, Answering Leighton Flowers"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Was running solo again today but managed to dive into a number of topics as well as get into the original language texts on topics such as Paul&#8217;s use of Psalm 2, 8, 110, and the nature of Christ&#8217;s kingdom and reign. We also talked a bit about Derek Webb&#8217;s deep dive into spiritual darkness, and finished up looking at a question Leighton Flowers asked two years ago about Christ&#8217;s sheep.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/6823231441307/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Was Jesus Enthroned in Daniel 7? What Does His Reign Mean? And Much More\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pXJy3B9kk0s?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Was running solo again today but managed to dive into a number of topics as well as get into the original language texts on topics such as Paul&#8217;s use of Psalm 2, 8, 110, and the nature of Christ&#8217;s kingdom and reign. We also talked a bit about Derek Webb&#8217;s deep dive into spiritual darkness, and finished up looking at [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
