        "title": {
          "rendered": "Helping Joe Rogan Know the Truth"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some folks were kind enough to link me to examples of Joe Rogan repeat common mythology about how the Bible was collected, the canon, Constantine, etc., so I took the time today to deal with those issues, as well as respond to a number of claims made in one clip as Rogan interviewed Lawrence Krauss, a well known atheist and former professor at ASU.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I think Joe Rogan would benefit greatly from viewing my 2009 debate with Bart Ehrman, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/5K-AOfj1Axg\">found here</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/525231521262503/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Helping Joe Rogan Know the Truth\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AMD6CHQ6vFQ?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Some folks were kind enough to link me to examples of Joe Rogan repeat common mythology about how the Bible was collected, the canon, Constantine, etc., so I took the time today to deal with those issues, as well as respond to a number of claims made in one clip as Rogan interviewed Lawrence Krauss, a well known atheist and [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
