        "title": {
          "rendered": "Road Trip DL: Report on Progress, Apologia Weighs In, Thoughts on Daniel 7, Mohler on Theonomy"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Halfway through my May trip, currently in Memphis, headed up toward Nashville before doubling back to Pryor, Oklahoma. Gave a bit of a report on <a href=\"https://www.sermonaudio.com/solo/gbcconway/sermons/5122314313881/\">my time at GBTS in Conway</a>, then got into<a href=\"https://youtu.be/LXQ_Q4eH0bg\"> Apologia Radio&#8217;s response to G3</a>, then moved on to consider how Daniel 7 relates to other key passages, and finished up reviewing <a href=\"https://www.9marks.org/article/theonomy-serious-theology-serious-politics-seriously-wrong/\">Albert Mohler&#8217;s article on theonomy</a> from a few weeks ago.  One brief interruption (another thing Rich is working on) but otherwise smooth sailing today!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/5132300412256/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Road Trip DL: Report on Progress, Apologia Weighs In, Thoughts on Daniel 7, Mohler on Theonomy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LWlk51uY4B0?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Halfway through my May trip, currently in Memphis, headed up toward Nashville before doubling back to Pryor, Oklahoma. Gave a bit of a report on my time at GBTS in Conway, then got into Apologia Radio&#8217;s response to G3, then moved on to consider how Daniel 7 relates to other key passages, and finished up reviewing Albert Mohler&#8217;s article on [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
