      "title": "More Attempts at Sneaking Man’s Autonomy into Scripture",
      "author": "Alpha and Omega Ministries (author ID 3)",
      "url": "https://www.aomin.org/aoblog/the-dividing-line/more-attempts-at-sneaking-mans-autonomy-into-scripture/",
      "sha256": "4881281c50acfc97adb0c614afe84f7e50c4d497b6a83d84ae557cc034c52d70",
      "bytes": 1671,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\aomin\\34130.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:13:45.424284+00:00",
