        "title": {
          "rendered": "Road Trip Dividing Line From Conway, Arkansas"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">I am at GBTS in Conway and we managed (despite some challenges!) to get a full DL in today!  Caught up with a lot that has happened over the past week or so on a number of topics.  Hope the discussion is useful and helpful in the midst of all the fog being produced today.  We will go for another program tomorrow as well!  See you then!</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/59232311364015/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Road Trip Dividing Line From Conway, Arkansas\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oODUqk8mB48?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>I am at GBTS in Conway and we managed (despite some challenges!) to get a full DL in today! Caught up with a lot that has happened over the past week or so on a number of topics. Hope the discussion is useful and helpful in the midst of all the fog being produced today. We will go for another [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
