      "title": "What Do We Do When Our View of Morality Is Seen as Hateful and Intolerant?",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/what-do-we-do-when-our-view-of-morality-is-seen-as-hateful-and-intolerant/",
      "sha256": "fdcc8dcd56fc96ac31748e2171a73a7c9af1ca5ee75ff691ba26c3ce1beba650",
      "bytes": 3323,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\8827.html",
