      "title": "Bully Pulpit: A New Series on the Rising Problem of Spiritual Abuse in the Church",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/bully-pulpit-a-new-series-on-the-rising-problem-of-spiritual-abuse-in-the-church/",
      "sha256": "0565435b1772fa146f1a1d5eafdea861f2707a72458ea2318e5ea7a30fe6b145",
      "bytes": 8344,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\8843.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:13:49.198400+00:00",
