      "title": "Why Does It Seem Like the Smartest People Are the Ones Who Reject Christianity?",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/why-does-it-seem-like-the-smartest-people-are-the-ones-who-reject-christianity/",
      "sha256": "79137f2c7df9abd07eb55a0b824be99f001a65d25c7a02ea1a951ec21f806feb",
