        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>How I Almost Lost My Faith in College: A Preview of My Latest Book - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/how-i-almost-lost-my-faith-in-college-a-preview-of-my-latest-book/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How I Almost Lost My Faith in College: A Preview of My Latest Book - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"In the fall of 1989, I began my freshman year at the University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill. Like many freshmen, I was excited for the next chapter in my life, eager to explore the new opportunities and experiences that college had to offer. Of course, I knew there would be challenges. College life [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/how-i-almost-lost-my-faith-in-college-a-preview-of-my-latest-book/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2021-01-13T14:07:49+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:00:47+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2021/01/university2-scaled-e1610471730634.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"465\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twi