        "title": {
          "rendered": "Lots of Topics on the DL Today"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Had a lot of mini issues to discuss at the top, then looked at an example of horrible racism, then discussed Derek Webb&#8217;s comments on a video posted by Leighton Flowers, then looked at the language used by Credo Magazine in self-defining &#8220;orthodoxy.&#8221; ADDENDUM:  I forgot to add the information for ordering that wonderful tomb-scene wooden artwork I showed on the program!  My apologies.  You can find out how to get them by going to the Facebook business page @CollinsCoWoodworking&amp;Decor, or by emailing Eric Collins at CollinsCoWoodworking@gmail.com.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/323231555324679/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Lots of Topics on the DL Today\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_8jhBUGQd7k?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Had a lot of mini issues to discuss at the top, then looked at an example of horrible racism, then discussed Derek Webb&#8217;s comments on a video posted by Leighton Flowers, then looked at the language used by Credo Magazine in self-defining &#8220;orthodoxy.&#8221; ADDENDUM: I forgot to add the information for ordering that wonderful tomb-scene wooden artwork I showed on [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
