          "rendered": "Apologizing for the Bible, Textual Critical Issues and the TR"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Back in the regular studio today.  Started off with a personal response to Andy Stanley on his apologizing for Christians seeking to apply &#8220;Christian rules&#8221; to non-Christians, and then looked a bit at Reuben Swanson&#8217;s books on the text of the NT (in reference to Thomas Ross&#8217; use thereof), finishing with a read-through of Brett Mahlen&#8217;s chapter on why he adopted TR Onlyism.</p>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://embed.sermonaudio.com/player/a/22823214305616/\" style=\"min-width: 150px;\" scrolling=\"no\" width=\"100%\" height=\"150\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Apologizing for the Bible, Textual Critical Issues and the TR\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pleWP2vr2LY?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;showinfo=0\" style=\"border: none\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>Back in the regular studio today. Started off with a personal response to Andy Stanley on his apologizing for Christians seeking to apply &#8220;Christian rules&#8221; to non-Christians, and then looked a bit at Reuben Swanson&#8217;s books on the text of the NT (in reference to Thomas Ross&#8217; use thereof), finishing with a read-through of Brett Mahlen&#8217;s chapter on why he [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
