          "og_description": "Ever had a moment in your life where you doubted what you believe? I mean, really doubted? I can still remember when that happened in my life. It was my freshman year at UNC-Chapel Hill as I was sitting in a religion class on the New Testament. The professor was bright, funny, and persuasive. And [&hellip;]",
