        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>What Exactly is Legalism? It&#039;s More Complicated Than You Think - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-exactly-is-legalism-its-more-complicated-than-you-think/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What Exactly is Legalism? It&#039;s More Complicated Than You Think - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Legalism. Pretty much everyone agrees that it&#8217;s bad.  And in a world where Christians seem to disagree over basically everything, that&#8217;s saying something. Even so, if you asked the average Christian to define legalism, the answers may not come so quickly. What exactly counts as legalism?  How do we know it when we see it?  [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-exactly-is-legalism-its-more-complicated-than-you-think/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2020-08-12T16:45:21+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:59:57+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2018/05/judging-e1526315938336.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"469\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<me