          "og_title": "How Early Christianity was Mocked for Welcoming Women - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "I recently received a question on Twitter about where in our patristic sources we see early Christianity mocked for being a religion filled with women.  The short answer: lots of places. But before we get there, we should begin by noting that early Christianity received this criticism precisely because it was so popular with women [&hellip;]",
