        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Why Do (Modern) Christians Rarely Talk about Rewards in Heaven? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/why-do-modern-christians-rarely-talk-about-rewards-in-heaven-2/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Why Do (Modern) Christians Rarely Talk about Rewards in Heaven? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"When is the last time you heard a sermon that suggested that a motive for our obedience should be the rewards we receive in heaven?  I imagine for most of us it has been a long time, maybe even never. Whenever a sermon (or book) provides a motive for obedience, it is almost always thankfulness [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/why-do-modern-christians-rarely-talk-about-rewards-in-heaven-2/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2020-05-26T13:21:02+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T22:00:02+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2020/05/reward-scaled-e1590422263261.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"495\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est