          "og_type": "article",
          "og_title": "Want to Understand How Suffering Fits with the Sovereignty of God? Here's a Great Place to Start - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "One of the perennial questions for all theologians (and all human beings) is “Why do we suffer?” And, “If God is good and sovereign, why does he allow suffering?” While most of us have these questions, we don’t really have to deal with them until we experience suffering ourselves. This is when we discover whether [&hellip;]",
