          "og_title": "Interested in Getting a Biblical Counseling Degree without Moving? You Can Do it @RTSCharlotte - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "A number of years ago, RTS Charlotte launched a two-year Master of Arts in Christian Counseling degree (MACC) and it has been wonderful to see how it has grown.  We believe that solid, Christ-centered, biblical counseling is critical to the health of the church. Two years ago we also announced that we are now offering [&hellip;]",
