          "og_title": "Off to San Diego for the Annual Meeting of the Evangelical Theological Society - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Next week, I head to beautiful San Diego for the 71st Annual Meeting of the Evangelical Theological Society, the largest gathering of evangelical scholars in the world. The theme this year is &#8220;Christ in All Scripture.&#8221; This year I will be delivering the presidential address at the Thursday night banquet. The title of my lecture [&hellip;]",
