          "canonical": "https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/was-early-christianity-hostile-to-women-2/",
          "og_locale": "en_US",
          "og_type": "article",
          "og_title": "Was Early Christianity Hostile to Women? - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Since we live in a culture that is obsessed with gender identity and gender issues, it is not surprising to find Christianity on the receiving end of serious criticisms regarding its view of women. Christianity–particularly if it embraces a complementarian theology–is viewed by many in our culture as oppressive and harmful to women.  It does [&hellip;]",
