        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Is the &quot;New Perspective on Paul&quot; a Product of Our Current Cultural Moment? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-new-perspective-on-paul-a-product-of-our-current-cultural-moment/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Is the &quot;New Perspective on Paul&quot; a Product of Our Current Cultural Moment? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ever since Krister Stendahl&#8217;s seminal essay, &#8220;The Apostle Paul and the Introspective Conscience of the West,&#8221; one of the foundational arguments for the New Perspective(s) on Paul (NPP) has been that the traditional protestant/reformed view of justification is largely due to the cultural influence of &#8220;the West&#8221; and its emphasis on individualism and subjectivism. Paul [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/is-the-new-perspective-on-paul-a-product-of-our-current-cultural-moment/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2019-05-20T12:02:14+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:58:29+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2019/05/Paul-rembrandt-e1558100605124.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1000\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"547\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\