          "og_locale": "en_US",
          "og_type": "article",
          "og_title": "Is the \"New Perspective on Paul\" a Product of Our Current Cultural Moment? - Canon Fodder",
          "og_description": "Ever since Krister Stendahl&#8217;s seminal essay, &#8220;The Apostle Paul and the Introspective Conscience of the West,&#8221; one of the foundational arguments for the New Perspective(s) on Paul (NPP) has been that the traditional protestant/reformed view of justification is largely due to the cultural influence of &#8220;the West&#8221; and its emphasis on individualism and subjectivism. Paul [&hellip;]",
