        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Do Christian Parents Have to be Perfect? - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/do-christian-parents-have-to-be-perfect/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Do Christian Parents Have to be Perfect? - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I recently did a number of videos for the TGC, and one of them was on lessons I&#8217;ve learned as a parent. We have three kids, 18, 15, 12, and have certainly learned a lot of lessons. Here&#8217;s one of the main ones: [iframe width=&#8221;1000&#8243; height=&#8221;500&#8243; src=&#8221;https://www.youtube.com/embed/pIm_gMY6QHE&#8221; frameborder=&#8221;0&#8243; allow=&#8221;accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#8221; allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/do-christian-parents-have-to-be-perfect/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2019-04-29T12:13:33+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:57:30+00:00\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\\/\\/michaeljkruger.5mt.site\\/do-christian-parents-have-to-be-perfect\\/#article\",