      "title": "Are We Allowed to Use OT Figures as Moral Examples?",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/are-we-allowed-to-use-ot-figures-as-moral-examples/",
      "sha256": "47c79acf96bbe339fef7897d148260ad8ec228b039345659bdf61c83ebc9667b",
      "bytes": 3185,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\7177.html",
