        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Want to Give a Book for Christmas? Here&#039;s My Top Ten List for Books on the Authority of Scripture - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/want-to-give-a-book-for-christmas-heres-my-top-ten-list-for-books-on-the-authority-of-scripture/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Want to Give a Book for Christmas? Here&#039;s My Top Ten List for Books on the Authority of Scripture - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"&#8216;Tis the season. . . to give books. I think solid Christian books are a great gift, and books on the authority of Scripture are always relevant in our world today. Thus, for your shopping pleasure, I have compiled an annotated list of the all-time 10 best books on this topic. It goes without saying [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/want-to-give-a-book-for-christmas-heres-my-top-ten-list-for-books-on-the-authority-of-scripture/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2018-12-10T12:48:48+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:57:41+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2012/05/Scripture-e1483708711605.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"975\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"359\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"t