          "og_description": "I am asked all the time about which faculty positions are hardest to fill.  Although the answer is debatable, I think that finding solid Old Testament professors is a significant challenge. There are a variety of reasons for this.  One is that there are just fewer of them.  In the Reformed world especially, we have [&hellip;]",
