        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>Some Recent Interactions with My Book on Second Century Christianity - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/some-recent-interactions-with-my-book-on-second-century-christianity/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Some Recent Interactions with My Book on Second Century Christianity - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I&#8217;ve been pleased this year to see so many encouraging responses to my new book, Christianity at the Crossroads: How the Second Century Shaped the Future of the Church (IVP Academic, 2018). Who would&#8217;ve thought people would be interested in the second century? For those who haven&#8217;t picked up a copy yet, this book highlights [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/some-recent-interactions-with-my-book-on-second-century-christianity/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2018-07-17T12:00:16+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:56:10+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2018/01/Crossroads-IVP-e1519305360317.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"350\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"525\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" conte