          "rendered": "<p>Some things never change.  At least when it comes to what critics think of Christianity. When we hear modern-day stereotypes of Christianity we might assume that they are, well, modern.  These are criticisms, we think, that pertain to the present cultural moment in which we find ourselves. But, a quick survey of the earliest Christian [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
