        "modified_gmt": "2023-04-14T21:54:44",
        "slug": "why-the-church-needs-more-female-theologians-a-lunch-conversation-at-the-tgc-womens-conference",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "post",
        "link": "https://michaeljkruger.com/why-the-church-needs-more-female-theologians-a-lunch-conversation-at-the-tgc-womens-conference/",
        "title": {
          "rendered": "Why the Church Needs More Female Theologians: A Lunch Conversation at the TGC Women&#8217;s Conference"
        },
        "content": {
          "rendered": "<p>My wife <a href=\"https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/blogs/melissa-kruger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Melissa</a> and I will both be speaking at the upcoming <a href=\"https://2018.thegospelcoalition.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TGC Women&#8217;s Conference</a> in Indianapolis, June 14-16.</p>\n<p>During that event, we have a special lunch-time event that I want to share with you.  If you are attending the conference, you are invited to come. Here are the details:</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><strong>Why the Church Needs More Female Theologians: A Lunch Conversation with Mike &amp; Melissa Kruger (FREE)</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">Friday, June 15 I 12:00pm I 209 Workshop Room</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">Reformed Theological Seminary invites you to join Mike and Melissa Kruger for lunch and a conversation about women in the church, seminary, and ministry. In addition to serving as the President of RTS-Charlotte, Mike is a pastor, author and professor. Melissa serves as the Women’s Ministry Coordinator for her church and also writes, teaches and blogs for TGC. Lunch will be provided for all who sign up by June 14. Register here: <a href=\"http://www.rtslunch.eventbrite.com/\">www.rtslunch.eventbrite.com</a></p>\n<p>If you have ever been to one of these conferences, you know that finding a place to eat at lunch time is quite the challenge.  But here&#8217;s an opportunity to come hear from Melissa and myself about the importance of theology among women.  Also you will get to hear more about how Reformed Theological Seminary is working to train women for all sorts of ministries in God&#8217;s Kingdom.</p>\n<p>But, make sure you RSVP as early as possible.  Space is very limited and we expect it to fill up quickly!  Again here is the link: <a href=\"http://www.rtslunch.eventbrite.com/\">www.rtslunch.eventbrite.com</a></p>\n<p>Hope to see you there!</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
        "excerpt": {
          "rendered": "<p>My wife Melissa and I will both be speaking at the upcoming TGC Women&#8217;s Conference in Indianapolis, June 14-16. During that event, we have a special lunch-time event that I want to share with you.  If you are attending the conference, you are invited to come. Here are the details: Why the Church Needs More [&hellip;]</p>\n",
          "protected": false
        },
