      "title": "Interested in Getting a Biblical Counseling Degree without Moving?  Now You Can Do It @RTSCharlotte",
      "author": "Michael Kruger",
      "url": "https://michaeljkruger.com/interested-in-getting-a-biblical-counseling-degree-without-moving-now-you-can-do-it-rtscharlotte/",
      "sha256": "635cb302503d32814922f4b7b2c9cbf291cacfabee20c3837741d73030b12bf8",
      "bytes": 3619,
      "format": "html",
      "path": "D:\\FortressOfSolitude\\Jarvis\\Projects\\BibleProject\\sources\\library\\bulk\\kruger\\6646.html",
      "acquiredAt": "2026-10-07T20:14:35.442350+00:00",
