        "yoast_head": "<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https://yoast.com/product/yoast-seo-wordpress/ -->\n<title>What is a &quot;Gospel&quot; Anyway? A Few Thoughts on Gospel Genre and Why it Matters - Canon Fodder</title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-is-a-gospel-anyway-a-few-thoughts-on-gospel-genre-and-why-it-matters/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What is a &quot;Gospel&quot; Anyway? A Few Thoughts on Gospel Genre and Why it Matters - Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"When it comes to reading (and interpreting ) the Gospels, one of the fundamental questions pertains to the kind of document we are reading.  What exactly is a &#8220;Gospel&#8221;?  And did the earliest readers of these books know what they were reading? Such questions may seem pedantic to the average reader, but they matter more [&hellip;]\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://michaeljkruger.5mt.site/what-is-a-gospel-anyway-a-few-thoughts-on-gospel-genre-and-why-it-matters/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Canon Fodder\" />\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2018-02-12T13:00:38+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2023-04-14T21:54:53+00:00\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://5mt.michaeljkruger.com/2013/08/John-e1483990144829.jpg\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"975\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"380\" />\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\" />\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Michael Kruger\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" />\n\t<meta name